===Etymology 2===
{{PIE root|en|bʰreg}}
From {{der|en|fr|refrain}}, from the {{der|en|fro|-}} verb {{m|fro|refraindre|t=to break off, repeat}}, from {{der|en|la|re-|t=back, again}} + {{m|la|frangō|t=break}}; compare {{cog|oc|refranhs|t=a refrain}}, {{m|oc|refranher|t=to repeat}}. See {{m|en|refract}} and the verb {{m|en|refrain}}.

====Noun====
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# The [[chorus]] or {{l|en|burden|id=music}} of a [[song]] [[repeat]]ed at the end of each [[verse]] or [[stanza]].
# A much repeated comment, complaint, or saying.

